   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Wind**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Weed Whore (version 1)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Weed Whore (version 2)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Up On Th' Hill**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Stacey**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Orbital Buffer**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Tastes Good On Th' Bun**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Weed Whore (version 3)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: I Gots A Weasel [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1990-07-26** (recommended): pre-FM broadcast master; 11 songs; 31 min [1]. Said about its sound: Static, distortion and dropouts are present, described as a byproduct of the original broadcast [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorded at Brower Student Center, Trenton State College, for the radio station WTSR FM [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1990-07-26**: source: Pre-FM [1]. Also: Ween handed this out as a demo cassette in the Pod era; Johnny restored it from Mickey's low-generation copy [1]",
